    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Nestled in a breathtaking coastal setting where the River Shannon meets the Atlantic Ocean, Claire View offers an unparalleled lifestyle opportunity just off the iconic Wild Atlantic Way. Situated on the scenic Littor Road, this property sits on a beautifully mature, landscaped site within an easy 1km stroll of the pristine Littor Strand and Beale Beach, and just 11km from the vibrant seaside resort of Ballybunion, famous for its world-renowned golf course. \r\n\r\nThe dwelling itself features a practical layout including an entrance porch and hallway, a cozy sitting room, a kitchen with a dedicated dining and living area, a bright sun lounge, three bedrooms (one ensuite) and a main bathroom. Externally, the private grounds boast gated vehicle and pedestrian access, a detached garage/workshop, an on-site well and a septic tank. While the home requires modernisation, upgraded services and enhanced insulation, its unbeatable coastal location and spacious mature site present boundless potential for discerning buyers seeking a dream seaside retreat or permanent home.\r\n\r\nViewing is a must, please call Dillon Prendiville Auctioneers 06821739."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Porch - 2.7m x 2.0m \r\nTiled flooring, dual aspect - overlooking the front garden.\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall - 1.7m x 4.0m \r\nFitted carpet and recessed cloak.\r\n\r\nSitting Room - 4.2m x 3.8m \r\nDual aspect with solid fuel open fireplace, built-in display and fitted carpet.\r\n\r\nLiving/Dining Room - 5.6m x 3.7m \r\nFitted carpet, dual aspect and archway to kitchen breakfast area.\r\n\r\nKitchen - 3.7m x 3.0m \r\nFully fitted kitchen with tiled splash back and rear door access to sun lounge.\r\n\r\nSun Lounge - 2.5m x 2.0m \r\nWith rear door access.\r\n\r\nCorridor - 5.6m x 1.0m \r\nFitted carpet and attic hatch.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.2m x 3.1m \r\nFitted carpet and recessed built-in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.0m x 4.0m \r\nWith recessed built-in wardrobe and fitted carpet - dual aspect.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.6m x 3.7m \r\nFitted carpet and recessed built-in wardrobe - dual aspect.\r\n\r\nEnsuite - 1.4m x 1.8m \r\nFully tiled with electric shower, toilet, wash basin and frosted windows.\r\n\r\nBathroom - 3.6m x 1.7m \r\nFully tiled, shorter ceiling with bath, wc, whb, shower and storage accessed from corridor.\r\n\r\nDetached Garage - 5.0m x 5.0m \r\nDetached garage/workshop space with vehicle and pedestrian access.\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Block built with slate roof.\r\nOnsite well and septic tank.\r\nElectricity connected.\r\nOil fired central heating.\r\nDouble glazed aluminium windows.\r\nBeautiful landscaped gardens.\r\nImmediate proximity to Littor Strand and Beale Beach.\r\nConcrete driveway, gated access and cattle grid.\r\n11km to Ballybunion & 19km Listowel."
      },
